---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from "../config";
---

<section id="origin" class="py-20 md:py-28 border-t border-[#E5DDD3] bg-[#F4EFEA]/60">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <!-- Section Label -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7A7268]">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#C26910]"></span>
      <span>Origin</span>
      <span class="text-[#D5CCC0]">·</span>
      <span>Devlog, Part 1</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start mb-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] font-normal text-[#26221E] leading-[1.2] mb-4">
          The one-line change that took <span class="italic font-serif text-[#C26910]">fifty minutes</span>.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed">
          I asked an early version of Phil to add one hidden <code class="text-xs bg-[#E8E1D7] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[#26221E] font-mono">&lt;meta name="easter-egg" content="hello world"&gt;</code> tag to a one-page Astro site. Any current model writes that line in two seconds. Here is where the other fifty minutes went.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFE9E2] border border-[#D5CCC0] text-xs space-y-3 font-mono">
        <div class="text-[#7A7268] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">What the run cost</div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-center pt-1">
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3]">
            <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#C26910] font-medium">438</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-[#7A7268] mt-0.5">Model Calls</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3]">
            <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#C26910] font-medium">3M+</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-[#7A7268] mt-0.5">Input Tokens</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#6B635B] text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
          The model wrote reasonable code. The harness around it tripped over its own guardrails, dropped context on every approval, and insisted on a failing test for a meta tag.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Root causes and fixes -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-10">
      <!-- Trap 1 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E06C75]"></span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#26221E] uppercase tracking-wide font-mono">1. Every <code class="normal-case">ls</code> needed approval</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The agent used <code class="font-mono text-xs text-[#26221E]">ls</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs text-[#26221E]">cat</code>, and <code class="font-mono text-xs text-[#26221E]">grep</code> to inspect the repository. None were on the execution allowlist, so each call paused for human approval. After each pause, the agent forgot its state and re-explored from zero.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] text-xs text-[#0B7A5A] font-mono">
          Fix: Read-only commands like ls, cat, and grep run without approval, inside the worktree, with symlink checks.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trap 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E06C75]"></span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#26221E] uppercase tracking-wide font-mono">2. Each retry started from zero</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Each approval, retry, or resume started a new agent session. Most of the 3 million tokens were the same context, sent again.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] text-xs text-[#0B7A5A] font-mono">
          Fix: SQLite checkpoints. A retry gets the diff and a summary of what already happened.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trap 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E06C75]"></span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#26221E] uppercase tracking-wide font-mono">3. TDD for a meta tag</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The orchestrator wanted a failing test before any code. A meta tag can't fail a unit test, so the agent looped in the red phase and never got out.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] text-xs text-[#0B7A5A] font-mono">
          Fix: A separate check task type, verified by a command like the build. No test required.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trap 4 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E06C75]"></span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#26221E] uppercase tracking-wide font-mono">4. No spending limit</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          A small website change on Sonnet ran 46 model calls and 1.56M tokens in 90 seconds ($3.17) with nothing to stop it.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] text-xs text-[#0B7A5A] font-mono">
          Fix: Model call caps, a dollar budget ($2 by default), and prompt caching.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Devlog Link Callout -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFE9E2] border border-[#D5CCC0] gap-4">
      <div class="text-xs text-[#4A443D]">
        <span class="font-semibold text-[#26221E]">The full write-up:</span>
        <span class="text-[#7A7268] block sm:inline sm:ml-1"><em>Building Phil, Part 1: Stop the Waste</em> walks through each root cause and the benchmark harness I built to catch the next one.</span>
      </div>
      <a
        href={SITE_CONFIG.links.devlogPart1}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#26221E] text-[#FAF8F5] text-xs font-mono font-medium hover:bg-[#3D3732] whitespace-nowrap transition-all"
      >
        <span>Read Part 1</span>
        <span>↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
